# Raw YouTube transcripts stay local.
#
# Two reasons. First, verbatim transcripts are the video creators' copyrighted work, and this
# repo is public — republishing them wholesale is not ours to do. Second, they're bulky and
# add nothing for the family, who read the distilled criteria instead.
#
# criteria/ IS committed: those are our own summaries and judgments, written in our words.
transcripts/*.md
!transcripts/README.md

# Anything containing money or identity. The repo is public.
**/pre-approval*
**/financials*
**/*ssn*
private/

.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Generated artifact build — regenerate with ./tools/build_artifact.py
build/
docs/_preview.html
